  "independent_evidence": [
    "Main read all five files in full: every constant, alias, repr(C) record/member, serde diagnostic member, empty constructor, helper and test branch. All current hashes match the child and validation receipt.",
    "Main independently checked null rejection before descriptor reference formation, consumed text/array copying and deferred invoke/user_data retention. No full Runtime decoder or unsafe-context audit is credited here.",
    "V4 scope installs V2 system registration and V1 component registration with placeholder unsupported domain slots. V3 bridge scope installs only bridge.call. The legacy V1 system function signature is not a currently wired V3 slot.",
    "Sound request adapter projects borrowed delivery data; executor checks outer call status first, then result V1 and inner business status, then bounds and copies diagnostics. Callback/table copies do not retain dynamic code.",
    "Editor catalog calls missing_capability only after a capability set membership miss; report uses !any(is_error). Diagnostic constructor itself does not query authorization or registry state.",
    "Tests assert fixed 64-bit layout/value/empty-slot contracts and exact diagnostic construction; seven ABI test functions plus one ordinary diagnostic test and one ignored release performance test were read, not executed. The aggregate ABI test also calls four independently mounted tests.",
    "Ignored performance helper prepares inputs outside measurements, alternates order for 21 samples and uses a nonempty nearest-rank p95 index. Printed clone counts are explanatory literals, not measured allocation counts.",
    "Main strengthened draft memory preconditions with no concurrent mutation and single-allocation slice bounds. Unused schema/storage_kind fields are not newly claimed to be dereferenced."
  ],
